{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Fundamental exercise {#fundamental_exercise}\n",
        "![](/images/Mimas tiliae.png){style=\"width:200px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "To reinforce what you have learnt please try the challenges in this chapter.\n",
        "\n",
        "Solutions are in the expandable boxes.\n",
        "Try your best to solve each challenge but use the solutions for help if you would like.\n",
        "Even if your method works it can be good to check the solution as there are many ways to do the same thing in python.\n",
        "\n",
        "In this exercise you are going to create, investigate, and manipulate data of UK moths found in light traps.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Fundamental exercise notebook\n",
        "![](/images/notebook.png){style=\"width:100px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "Create a new notebook called \"02-Fundamental_exercises\". Use this notebook to carry out the challenges.\n",
        "\n",
        "Remember to use __markdown cells__ to make headers and to save often.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Moth light trap challenges\n",
        "\n",
        "### Moth challenge 1 {-}\n",
        "![](/images/moth_1.png){style=\"width:100px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "Create a __list variable__ called __\"moth_sightings_21sep\"__ with the ordered __string__ values:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. \"Poplar Hawk-moth\"\n",
        "2. \"Elephant Hawk-moth\"\n",
        "3. \"Elephant Hawk-moth\"\n",
        "4. \"Cinnabar\"\n",
        "5. \"Poplar Hawk-moth\"\n",
        "6. \"Scarlet Tiger\"\n",
        "7. \"Scalloped Oak\"\n",
        "\n",
        "This is the species of the individual moths that visited the light trap on the 21st night of September. \n",
        "\n",
        "Then view the __list__.\n",
        "\n",
        "`r hide(\"Moth 1 solution\")`"
      ],
      "id": "3a47febd"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#1\n",
        "moth_sightings_21sep = [\"Poplar Hawk-moth\", \"Elephant Hawk-moth\", \"Elephant Hawk-moth\",\n",
        "                        \"Cinnabar\", \"Poplar Hawk-moth\", \"Scarlet Tiger\", \"Scalloped Oak\"]\n",
        "moth_sightings_21sep"
      ],
      "id": "7e528c8b",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`r unhide()`\n",
        "\n",
        "### Moth challenge 2 {-}\n",
        "![](/images/moth_2.png){style=\"width:150px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "Using python code, calculate the percentage of individuals that were __Elephant Hawk-moths__ in __\"moth_sightings_21sep\"__.\n",
        "\n",
        "__Tip:__ Operators, the __function__ `len()` and the __method__ `.count()` (it can be used on string __lists__) will be useful.\n",
        "\n",
        "`r hide(\"Moth 2 solution\")`"
      ],
      "id": "dcd667b9"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#2\n",
        "(moth_sightings_21sep.count(\"Elephant Hawk-moth\") / len(moth_sightings_21sep)) * 100"
      ],
      "id": "b5b97de6",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`r unhide()`\n",
        "\n",
        "### Moth challenge 3 {-}\n",
        "![](/images/moth_3.png){style=\"width:150px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "Create a __set__ called __unique_moths__ from the __\"moth_sightings_21sep\"__ list.\n",
        "\n",
        "`r hide(\"Moth 3 solution\")`"
      ],
      "id": "2da66ee9"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#3\n",
        "unique_moths = set(moth_sightings_21sep)\n",
        "unique_moths"
      ],
      "id": "6086877c",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`r unhide()`\n",
        "\n",
        "### Moth challenge 4 {-}\n",
        "![](/images/moth_4.png){style=\"width:150px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "Create a new __list variable__ called __\"moth_sightings_22sep\"__ with the ordered __string__ values:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. \"Poplar Hawk-moth\"\n",
        "2. \"Elephant Hawk-moth\"\n",
        "3. \"Elephant Hawk-moth\"\n",
        "4. \"Cinnabar\"\n",
        "5. \"Feathered Thorn\"\n",
        "6. \"Scarlet Tiger\"\n",
        "7. \"Elephant Hawk-moth\"\n",
        "\n",
        "__Tip__: It can be useful to copy, paste, and edit previous code.\n",
        "\n",
        "`r hide(\"Moth 4 solution\")`"
      ],
      "id": "d03a155c"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#4\n",
        "moth_sightings_22sep = [\"Poplar Hawk-moth\", \"Elephant Hawk-moth\", \"Elephant Hawk-moth\",\n",
        "                        \"Cinnabar\", \"Feathered Thorn\", \"Scarlet Tiger\", \"Elephant Hawk-moth\"]\n",
        "moth_sightings_22sep"
      ],
      "id": "23d8f933",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`r unhide()`\n",
        "\n",
        "### Moth challenge 5 {-}\n",
        "![](/images/moth_5.png){style=\"width:150px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "Add the string __variable__ __\"Feathered Thorn\"__ to the __set__  __\"unique_moths\"__.\n",
        "\n",
        "`r hide(\"Moth 5 solution\")`"
      ],
      "id": "05f439f6"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#5\n",
        "unique_moths.add(\"Feathered Thorn\")\n",
        "unique_moths"
      ],
      "id": "67f17d18",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`r unhide()`\n",
        "\n",
        "### Moth challenge 6 {-}\n",
        "![](/images/moth_6.png){style=\"width:150px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "This is a multi stage challenge.\n",
        "Subset the __lists__ in the following ways:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Subset the 1st value of __\"moth_sightings_21sep\"__.\n",
        "2. Subset the 3rd to 5th values of __\"moth_sightings_22sep\"__.\n",
        "3. Subset the second last value of __\"moth_sightings_21sep\"__.\n",
        "4. Subset the first 4 values of __\"moth_sightings_22sep\"__.\n",
        "5. Subset the values from the 5th to the end of __\"moth_sightings_21sep\"__.\n",
        "6. Subset the three last values of __\"moth_sightings_22sep\"__.\n",
        "\n",
        "`r hide(\"Moth 6 solution\")`"
      ],
      "id": "93572c74"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#6.1\n",
        "moth_sightings_21sep[0]"
      ],
      "id": "68c472d4",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#6.2\n",
        "moth_sightings_22sep[2:5]"
      ],
      "id": "22719a1f",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#6.3\n",
        "moth_sightings_21sep[-2]"
      ],
      "id": "a11e997a",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#6.4\n",
        "moth_sightings_22sep[:4]"
      ],
      "id": "b7206e45",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#6.5\n",
        "moth_sightings_21sep[4:]"
      ],
      "id": "1f9a859d",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#6.6\n",
        "moth_sightings_22sep[-3:]"
      ],
      "id": "d0445033",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`r unhide()`\n",
        "\n",
        "### Moth challenge 7 {-}\n",
        "![](/images/moth_7.png){style=\"width:150px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "Create a __dictionary__ called __\"moth_visits_sep\"__ containing the following __key__ & __value__ pairs:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. \"Poplar Hawk-moth\" : 45\n",
        "2. \"Elephant Hawk-moth\" : 72\n",
        "3. \"Cinnabar\" : 23\n",
        "4. \"Scarlet Tiger\" : 32\n",
        "5. \"Scalloped Oak\" : 10\n",
        "\n",
        "`r hide(\"Moth 7 solution\")`"
      ],
      "id": "2d04e0ca"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#7\n",
        "moth_visits_sep = {\n",
        "  \"Poplar Hawk-moth\" :  45, \n",
        "  \"Elephant Hawk-moth\" : 72,\n",
        "  \"Cinnabar\" : 23,\n",
        "  \"Scarlet Tiger\" : 32,\n",
        "  \"Scalloped Oak\" : 10\n",
        "}\n",
        "moth_visits_sep"
      ],
      "id": "925b40f4",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`r unhide()`\n",
        "\n",
        "### Moth challenge 8 {-}\n",
        "![](/images/moth_8.png){style=\"width:150px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "Add the __key/value__ pair __\"Feathered Thorn\" : 13__ to the __dictionary__ __\"moth_visits_sep\"__.\n",
        "\n",
        "`r hide(\"Moth 8 solution\")`"
      ],
      "id": "fd12c09a"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#8\n",
        "moth_visits_sep[\"Feathered Thorn\"] = 13\n",
        "moth_visits_sep"
      ],
      "id": "341cfc3a",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`r unhide()`\n",
        "\n",
        "## Moth exercise conclusion\n",
